# GMS Core polls adbd_prop (USB debugging state) periodically; denied on
# this device tree since it wasn't paired with AlphaDroid's own device/alpha
# sepolicy (we used LineageOS's device tree instead). get_prop(), not
# r_file_perms: the latter includes ioctl/lock, which system/sepolicy's own
# neverallow forbids on property files (private/property.te says as much:
# "likely the policy is using r_file_perms directly instead of get_prop()").
get_prop(gmscore_app, adbd_prop)

# NOTE: gmscore_app was also observed denied "setattr" on its own
# self-downloaded Dynamite/GmsCoreVic split APKs (e.g. AdsDynamite) right
# after install - tried granting apk_data_file:file setattr, but that hits
# system/sepolicy's private/app.te:638-640 neverallow (only "platform_app",
# not regular appdomain members like gmscore_app, may setattr apk_data_file
# - deliberate hardening against apps tampering with installed APK files),
# so left denied on purpose.
